 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.4.4-rc4 — Live media timeline
+
+- Added real Windows media-session position and duration to Now Playing.
+- Chatbox music status now shows a live timestamp such as 1:24/5:32 when timeline data is available.
+- Increased media timeline refresh frequency so the displayed position stays believable while a song is playing.
+- Made the UWX live-preview surface transparent.
+
 ## 0.4.3-rc3 — UWX chatbox signature
 
 - Added an optional UWX branding block to OSC Chatbox Composer.
